 "fitted_on": "data/train.txt (991 icons)",
 "notes": "frames[preset] = [[background, gain, share of the preset's training actions, hue or null], ...], default first; hue = the background hue-shifted to that CIELAB hue (degrees; see shift()), used where no frame matches; nearest[preset] = preset whose frames a preset without action icons borrows (closest mid-lightness a*b*). frames_illithid / nearest_illithid: the same for illithid powers, always the veins (tadpole), entries may carry a 5th field, the chroma scale of the recolour. recipe[spell|action|illithid][default|preset] = KEYS (see parts()): background gain; darken-only sharpening (amount, radius px at 64); dark glow from the line cores (from, strength, blur, curve); glow colour kept and its curve; closed-shape tint; glow thinning; glow cover; light over everything (gain, px, edge, add); glyph unsharp; frame light under the glyph (gain, px, add); line colours (contrast, colourfulness, lift); glow colourfulness over the lines'; hue turn (degrees); bloom in the glyph's glow colour (strength, px). Shorter recipes lack the later keys (off: NEUTRAL). recipe_style = D22 style per entry: crisp (darken-only sharpening, no glyph unsharp) or soft (glyph unsharp, no darken-only sharpening). A preset with its own entry refit PER_PRESET (SMALL_KEYS under MIN_PRESET icons) on its training icons (recipe_for). Spells: spell_bg. Actions: framed backgrounds only. eval.registered[icon] = illithid cell lined up: zoom, dy, dx, L* correlation as is, lined up (register()).",
